/*
 *
 * Aggregates all generator values related to scope and control-flow constructs.
 *
 * This module serves as the public entry point for the generator IR nodes that
 * represent structured control flow: blocks, loops, conditionals, exceptions,
 * and other scope-bound constructs. Each concrete control-flow value is defined
 * in its own submodule, while this file re-exports them under a flat and stable
 * namespace.
 *
 * The module also defines ScopeValue, the abstract ancestor for all control-flow
 * generator values. ScopeValue provides the common semantic properties shared by
 * all scope-introducing constructs.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::generator::value::scope
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/generator/value/scope.yr
 * @Author(s):
